# Accepted IaC misconfiguration findings (Trivy). Reviewed and intentionally
# deferred; re-evaluate when the charts gain writable-volume plumbing.

# KSV0014 — Container should set securityContext.readOnlyRootFilesystem to true.
# Deferred: a read-only root FS requires per-path writable emptyDir mounts
# (nginx writes /var/cache/nginx and /var/run; the Node apps write /tmp). The
# risk is mitigated by runAsNonRoot, allowPrivilegeEscalation: false, and
# dropping ALL capabilities, which are enforced on every container.
KSV0014
AVD-KSV-0014

# The operator reconciles Shop resources across namespaces and must manage
# their generated Secrets and Services. These permissions cannot be replaced
# with a single namespaced Role without breaking reconciliation.
KSV-0041
AVD-KSV-0041
KSV-0056
AVD-KSV-0056
